      "name": "Verify the export before it is deployed",
      "summary": "Run the verifier set over the built tree between the export and the deploy, blocking it: pass, fail or could-not-tell, and the caller deploys only on a pass.",
      "description": "Run the verifier set over the built tree between the export and the deploy, blocking it: pass, fail or could-not-tell, and the caller deploys only on a pass. Bean vigi, owner 2026-09-23: a set of post-processing tools that verify what the build produced, run BEFORE deployment and blocking — \"a failure triggers an alert to the publisher manager\". This process only verifies and says how it went; the caller (docs-site-publish) blocks the deploy on anything but a pass and routes the failure through Process_PublishAlert, the one alert every step after the publish button shares.",
      "enforcement": "strict",
